  "len": 23,
  "en": "Ymir: ...Thank you...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 586,
  "text_len": 20
 },
 {
  "id": "sce144:00262",
  "jp": "セリカ「よしよし。さて、あとはこのレイオードを‥‥{nl}　ん？　操縦席を一刺し‥‥あれ？　変ね‥‥{nl}　剣の侵入角度からああいうふうにはなるはず‥‥‼」",
  "off": 610,
  "len": 99,
  "en": "Celica: There, there. Now, all that's left is this Rayode... Hm? One stab to the cockpit... Huh? That's odd... From the sword's angle of entry, it should've ended up like... !!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 612,
  "text_len": 96
 },
 {
  "id": "sce144:002C8",
  "jp": "ユミール「どうしたの？」",
